"««»\n"
"%(note)s\n"
"««»"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid ""
"Your appeal of [this decision](%(log)s) was looked at, and the decision stands.\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"%(note)s\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"Din appell av [denne avgjørelsen](%(log)s) ble sett på, og beslutningen står.\n"
"\n"
"««»\n"
"%(note)s\n"
"««»"

#, machine, plain2, python-format
msgid ""
"Your appeal of [this decision](%(log)s) was not taken further.\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"%(note)s\n"
